# PixelLab MCP

When generating or editing pixel art, sprites, tilesets, or animations with PixelLab, first read the full tool overview:

https://api.pixellab.ai/mcp/docs

Use the `pixellab` MCP server configured in [`.cursor/mcp.json`](../mcp.json). Follow the docs for tool names, parameters, and workflows rather than guessing.
